{"id":"n13973-1-12","stage":1,"title":"연결 · 连接","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n13973-1-12-1","ko":"여기 인터넷을 어떻게 연결하는지 아니?","zh":"你知道这里要怎么连接网络吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"인터넷을","meaning":"互联网","explanation":"인터넷：互联网；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인터넷","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70774","senseId":"1","lemma":"인터넷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인터넷을","audio":"/audio/a400bdd37ca9f06e7437.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"연결하는지","meaning":"连接","explanation":"연결하다：连接；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"연결하다","audio":"/audio/f2f28a5f59fa0c79bcfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67633","senseId":"1","lemma":"연결하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연결하는지","audio":"/audio/006c863e0e7ec7c6471b.mp3"}},{"text":"아니?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"020698f8f7c78429","term":"인터넷","zh":"互联网","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3","entryId":"70774","definition":"连接全世界的电脑使其可以互相交换信息的巨大电脑通信网。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"f2f28a5f59fa0c79","term":"연결하다","zh":"连接","audio":"/audio/f2f28a5f59fa0c79bcfa.mp3","entryId":"67633","definition":"两个以上的事物或现象等相互连起或形成关系。","pronunciation":["연결하다"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6db3447543dddc78be28.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n13973-1-12-2","ko":"아마 자동 연결이 될 거야.","zh":"应该会自动连接的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아마","meaning":"也许","explanation":"아마：也许。","readings":[{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71248","senseId":"1","lemma":"아마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}},{"text":"자동","meaning":"自动","explanation":"자동：自动。","readings":[{"term":"자동","audio":"/audio/ca7eb2ef0a71d4f5568c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70798","senseId":"1","lemma":"자동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자동","audio":"/audio/ca7eb2ef0a71d4f5568c.mp3"}},{"text":"연결이","meaning":"连接，连结","explanation":"연결：连接，连结；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연결","audio":"/audio/32dd2947e74266d57d4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13973","senseId":"1","lemma":"연결","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연결이","audio":"/audio/e6d12986623ed9e48579.mp3"}},{"text":"될","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"될","audio":"/audio/dc84eeabbbd47f74f20a.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2a38de25ef5f5194","term":"아마","zh":"也许","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3","entryId":"71248","definition":"虽然不能说得很明确，猜测或估计很有可能地。","pronunciation":["아마"]},{"id":"ca7eb2ef0a71d4f5","term":"자동","zh":"自动","audio":"/audio/ca7eb2ef0a71d4f5568c.mp3","entryId":"70798","definition":"机器等按一定的装置自己运转。","pronunciation":["자동"]},{"id":"32dd2947e74266d5","term":"연결","zh":"连接，连结","audio":"/audio/32dd2947e74266d57d4d.mp3","entryId":"13973","definition":"两个以上的事物或现象等被相互连接或缔结关系。","pronunciation":["연결"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/45707ad56e66fa5e6e53.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=13973","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":58,"sequenceScore":2.6653,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["应该会自动连接的吧。","你知道这里要怎么连接网络吗？","你有厨师资格证吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你知道这里要怎么连接网络吗？","你有厨师资格证吗？","应该会自动连接的吧。"],"answer":2}]}
